<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<section xml:id="mlc">
  <title>Mathematics Learning Center (MLC)</title>

  <p>
    Free math tutoring, online via Zoom or face to face in Heafey 223, is
    available through the Mathematics Learning Center. You can set up a
    one-to-one appointment, sign up for a weekly study group, or come to a
    power up session to strengthen a specific skill. Students need to register
    ahead for these services.
  </p>

  <p>
    For quick last-minute questions, try drop-in tutoring from 6 to 8 PM on
    Sunday, Tuesday, and Thursday evenings.
  </p>
</section>
